  "body": "Step 2 of `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">`'s process the linked resource algorithm returns immediately if the element no longer contributes to the styling process model. It doesn't decrement the document's script-blocking style sheet counter though, so if it was incremented before by the `link` element, scripts will remain blocked.",
